# Vertical: baseline in a horizontal Stack (reference/components/stack.md): page of 240 × 160 with margins of 20, page
# area of 200 × 120 from (20, 20). With the test metrics each character measures half its size, and the baseline of
# a line is 80 % of the size below the top of the text, centered in the line: 9 in a text of size 10 in lines of 12,
# and 18 in one of size 20 in lines of 24.
#   total: a label of size 10, a figure of size 20 and its unit, of size 10, on the same baseline, 18 below the top
#          of the line: the label and the unit go 9 lower than the figure. The line is 24 tall. y = 20.
#   top:   the same three with Vertical: top, to compare: the three at the top of the line. y = 54.
#   mixed: an image without text, which rests its bottom on the baseline (18 − 12 = 6 below the top); a box with a
#          border of 1, padding of 4 and two lines, whose first line is 5 + 9 = 14 below its top (4 below the top of
#          the line) and leaves 34 − 14 = 20 below the baseline, so the line is 18 + 20 = 38 tall; the figure; and a
#          text with Vertical: bottom in its Item, at the bottom of the line (38 − 12 = 26). y = 88.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Width: 240
		Height: 160
		Margin: 20
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
				Line height: 12
		For style: figure
			Typography:
				Size: 20
				Line height: 24
				Bold: true
		For element: Stack
			Gap: 5
			Box:
				Margin: 0 0 10 0
	Section:
		Stack:
			Id: total
			Vertical: baseline
			Item:
				Text: TOTAL
					Id: label
			Item:
				Text: 1.234
					Id: amount
					Style: figure
			Item:
				Text: EUR
					Id: unit
		Stack:
			Id: top
			Vertical: top
			Item:
				Text: TOTAL
					Id: top-label
			Item:
				Text: 1.234
					Id: top-amount
					Style: figure
			Item:
				Text: EUR
					Id: top-unit
		Stack:
			Id: mixed
			Vertical: baseline
			Item:
				Image: test/square.png
					Id: image
					Alt: Cuadrado
					Box:
						Width: 12
			Item:
				Block:
					Id: boxed
					Box:
						Padding: 4
						Border: 1
					Text: dos
					Text: filas
			Item:
				Text: 99
					Id: mixed-amount
					Style: figure
			Item:
				Vertical: bottom
				Text: fin
					Id: end
